  example:"A rehabilitation centre in Puducherry forms a closed group of 8 stroke survivors who can walk with supervision, running a twice-weekly circuit class with step-ups, sit to stand and walking stations.",
  flags:["Mixing very weak and very fit patients","Inadequate supervision for the group size","No individual monitoring of vital signs"],
